			"notes": "Includes support for Minecraft 1.20.2. Only a couple months late. Also some long overdue bugtweakfixes. Uni student moment.\n\nBugfixes:\n- Waypoint rendering when using resource packs with font textures should be fixed (previously didn't render certain map/waypoint text)\n- \\[DevEnv\\] gradle-wrapper.properties is now included in the repo, it should be possible to clone and build now without updating gradle.\n\nAdded:\n- **Waypoint [temporary] highlighting.** Need to see something NOW and on top of everything else? Click the highlighter to the left of a waypoint in the menu. Highlights bypass visibility toggles and filters, if waypoint rendering is enabled you will see them. This has been done for months, I should have pushed it sooner.\n\nMinor Tweaks:\n- Auto-Position and Draw Mode description tweaked in the readme.\n- Default max-ui-scale for waypoints on the map set to 2 (previously 1).\n- Updated loom to 1.4 and gradle to 8.3."
		},
