			"notes": "Quick patch to fix two bugs preventing waypoint importing.\n\nIf you imported waypoints and did not encounter any errors, check to make sure waypoints for dimensions that were not loaded at time of import or during your play session were actually saved.\n\nBugfixes:\n- The Xaero waypoint importer should no longer cause groups to be generated with the same UUID and no name.\n- The Xaero waypoint importer should now save a world's waypoints after immediately import rather than at an indeterminate time (if at all).\n\nAdded:\n- Changing resource packs now immediately schedules all loaded regions to be re-rendered with the new textures.\n- A Remove All button was added to the Import List screen.\n- Added a waypoint group and filter section to the Readme guide.\n\nMinor Changes:\n- In the Readme guide: replaced a screenshot with one from a non-dev world and clarified the \"Default Data\" option in importers."
		},
